%% MoneyMint Mobile App High-Level State Diagram
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Boot
    Boot : Launch Expo app
    Boot --> Hydrating : load SecureStore token

    Hydrating --> Authenticated : token valid & user hydrated
    Hydrating --> Unauthenticated : no token or hydration failed

    Unauthenticated --> AuthFlow : user lands on login/signup stack
    AuthFlow --> Authenticated : login/signup succeeds

    Authenticated --> MainTabs : Dashboard, Invest, Customers, Reports, Profile

    state MainTabs {
        [*] --> Dashboard
        Dashboard --> Invest : user taps Invest tab
        Dashboard --> Customers : manage customers
        Dashboard --> Reports : view analytics summary
        Dashboard --> Profile : manage account
        Invest --> Dashboard : back navigation
        Customers --> Dashboard : back navigation
        Reports --> Dashboard : back navigation
        Profile --> Dashboard : back navigation
    }

    state InvestFlow{
        [*] --> Idle
        Idle --> Collecting : user enters amount & category
        Collecting --> Submitting : user taps "Get AI Insight"
        Submitting --> InsightReady : API returns success
        Submitting --> Error : API failure
        InsightReady --> ViewingBrief : user dismisses modal
        ViewingBrief --> Idle : user edits input or returns to tabs
        Error --> Idle : user retries
    }

    MainTabs --> Authenticated : passive state
    Authenticated --> SigningOut : user triggers logout
    SigningOut --> Unauthenticated : SecureStore cleared
```
